{
  "name": "@skillvault/nsm",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "Neuro-Swarm Mesh (NSM): A 100% non-LLM, biologically-inspired memory architecture pairing SQLite FTS5 BM25 storage with in-memory graph spreading activation, ant colony pheromone evaporation, and OpenIE extraction.",
